  {
    "id": "5f0a32000f954189",
    "source": "&526 A large gash has left much of the power-cable exposed and uninsulated. Based on the track-marks, you guess that someone was careless with the cutting laser.",
    "target": "&526 一道大豁口，让电缆相当一部分裸露在外，没了绝缘保护。根据切割痕迹，你猜有人用激光器时不太小心。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "25ce738560d07e62",
    "source": "&531 Judging by the frequency and nature of the warnings around the room, this machinery must have been exceptionally hazardous to the human eye.",
    "target": "&531 这里的警告既多又严厉，看来，这些机器对人眼格外危险。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
